  group_integration_method -lobatto: the GNU keeps the 14-point default
  rule {same results as prism12_gauss1}. The Professional 02-08-2026
  -minimal rule is the 4-point tria6 rule {centroid weight -27/48} x 2
  Gauss levels: an indefinite element stiffness, "Error with pardiso
  solver." on a fixed-base prism of height 0.2 [DIVERGENCES PRISM12-MINIMAL,
  the C82 / C132 rule of the prism15 and prism18]. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
